  "body_html": "<p>Celebrate the most wonderful time of the year with this beautifully designed Christmas quilt. Crafted from premium microfiber, this quilt offers exceptional softness and breathability, ensuring lasting comfort while adding a cheerful holiday touch to your home decor. It's perfect for keeping cozy on chilly nights or as a festive bedspread.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Festive Holiday Design:</strong> Adorned with bright, high-quality Christmas prints to create a warm and joyful atmosphere in any room.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Comfort:</strong> Made from soft, lightweight microfiber, providing warmth in winter and coolness in warmer months for year-round versatility.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Multiple Sizes:</strong> Available in Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") to perfectly fit beds, sofas, or as a decorative seasonal quilt.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> A cozy and meaningful present for loved ones during Christmas, New Year, birthdays, or other holiday celebrations.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable with cold water on a gentle cycle, and tumble dry low or air dry for fade-resistant and wrinkle-free softness.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Christmas Quilt-ds07</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine washable with cold water on gentle cycle; Tumble dry low or air dry</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
